# Sample PDFs are large binaries and contain customer drawings; keep the
# manifest, not the files. `**` is required — `samples/*.pdf` only matches the
# top level and would let samples/set1/** and samples/set2/** through.
samples/**/*.pdf
samples/**/*.zip
samples/**/*.xlsx
samples/**/*.csv
!samples/README.md
